  "language" : "pt-BR",
  "text" : {
    "status" : "extensions",
    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xml:lang=\"pt-BR\" lang=\"pt-BR\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narrativa gerada: CapabilityStatement CapabilityStatement-EHRServices</b></p><a name=\"CapabilityStatement-EHRServices\"> </a><a name=\"hcCapabilityStatement-EHRServices\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Língua: pt-BR</p></div><h2 id=\"title\">CapabilityStatement do EHR-Services da RNDS</h2><ul><li>Guia de implementação Versão: 1.0.0-release </li><li>Versão FHIR: 4.0.1 </li><li>Formatos suportados: <code>application/fhir+xml</code>, <code>xml</code>, <code>application/fhir+json</code>, <code>json</code></li><li>Publicado em: 2026-09-28 17:50:50-0300 </li><li>Publicado por: Ministério da Saúde do Brasil </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Nota para os implementadores: Capacidades FHIR</strong></p><p>Qualquer capacidade FHIR pode ser &quot;permitida&quot; pelo sistema, exceto se for explicitamente assinalada como &quot;NÃO DEVE&quot;. Alguns itens são marcados como MAY no Guia de Implementação para destacar a sua potencial relevância para o caso de utilização.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">Capacidades FHIR RESTful</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"/></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capacidades por recurso/perfil</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Resumo</h4><p>A tabela de resumo enumera os recursos que fazem parte desta configuração e, para cada recurso, enumera-os:</p><ul><li>Os perfis relevantes (se existirem)</li><li>As interações suportadas por cada recurso (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>só estão presentes se pelo menos um dos recursos os suportar.</li><li><span>Os parâmetros de pesquisa obrigatórios, recomendados e alguns opcionais (se existirem). </span></li><li>Os recursos ligados activados para <code>_include</code></li><li>Os outros recursos activados para <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>As operações sobre o recurso (se existirem)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Tipo de recurso</b></th><th><b>Perfil</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET um recurso (interação de leitura)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET todo o conjunto de recursos do tipo (interação de pesquisa)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT uma nova versão do recurso (interação de atualização)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST um novo recurso (criar interação)\">C</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"ELIMINAR um recurso (eliminar interação)\">D</b></th><th><b title=\"Parâmetros de pesquisa necessários e recomendados\">Pesquisas</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operações</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Bundle1-1\">Bundle</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Bundle</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td></td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#CodeSystem1-2\">CodeSystem</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/CodeSystem</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td></td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td><code>$lookup</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Composition1-3\">Composition</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/composition.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Composition</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>subject, _bookmark, _count</td><td><code>Composition:author</code>, <code>Composition:subject</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td><code>$document</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Consent1-4\">Consent</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/consent.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Consent</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td></td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#List1-5\">List</a></td><td>http://www.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/StructureDefinition/BRListaTimeline-1.0</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>code, subject</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>List:subject</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#OperationDefinition1-6\">OperationDefinition</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/operationdefinition.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/OperationDefinition</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td></td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Organization1-7\">Organization</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/organization.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Organization</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>identifier</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Patient1-8\">Patient</a></td><td>http://rnds.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/StructureDefinition/rnds-patient-1.0</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_bookmark, _count, birthdate, birthplace, gender, mothers-name, name, identifier</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Practitioner1-9\">Practitioner</a></td><td>http://rnds.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/StructureDefinition/rnds-practitioner-1.0</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>identifier</td><td><code>*</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#PractitionerRole1-10\">PractitionerRole</a></td><td>http://rnds.saude.gov.br/fhir/r4/StructureDefinition/rnds-practitionerrole-1.0</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>organization, practitioner</td><td><code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td><code>Composition:subject</code>, <code>List:subject</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code></td><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Bundle1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Conformidade do recurso: unspecified </span>Bundle</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Perfil do sistema de base</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/bundle.html\">Bundle</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Conformidade do perfil</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Política de referência</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Resumo da interação</span><br/><ul><li>Apoios <code>create</code>, <code>delete</code>, <code>read</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"CodeSystem1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Conformidade do recurso: unspecified </span>CodeSystem</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"contai